WEBVTT

00:44:27.394 --> 00:44:33.031
but AI will be able to do most of the jobs
of 40 percent of the people

00:44:33.055 --> 00:44:37.197
at a much lower cost
and higher accuracy and efficiency.

00:44:37.689 --> 00:44:40.849
So will that lead
to a big unemployment problem?

00:44:40.873 --> 00:44:42.276
We don't know.

00:44:42.300 --> 00:44:45.814
Because we don't know how
technical feasibility

00:44:45.838 --> 00:44:49.584
will translate into actual employers

00:44:49.608 --> 00:44:53.076
deciding to displace people
with automation.

00:44:53.418 --> 00:44:56.323
But I think what it will
definitely lead to

00:44:56.347 --> 00:44:58.728
is a large number of people

00:44:58.752 --> 00:45:01.696
who have been doing
routine work for decades